uires ~26 GB+ VRAM.** Recommended if you have enough VRAM and want the highest possible quality.\n- **FP8** – Best all-around choice for **RTX 40-series and RTX 50-series**. Excellent balance of speed, VRAM usage, image quality, and compatibility. Recommended for most users.\n- **INT8** – Recommended for **RTX 30-series**. Lower VRAM usage than BF16 while maintaining very good image quality.\n- **NVFP4** – Designed for **RTX 50-series (Blackwell)** GPUs. Lowest VRAM usage and fastest on supported hardware, though some custom nodes may not fully support it yet.\n\n**Quick recommendation:**\n- RTX 30xx → **INT8**\n- RTX 40xx → **FP8**\n- RTX 50xx (Blackwell) → **NVFP4** (or **FP8** if you encounter compatibility issues)\n- Maximum quality → **BF16 (26 GB+ VRAM)**\n\n---\n\n## 🇨🇳 我该使用哪个模型？\n\n- **BF16** – 画质最佳、兼容性最好。**需要约 26 GB 以上显存。** 如果你的显存充足，并且追求最高画质，推荐使用。\n- **FP8** – **RTX 40 系列和 RTX 50 系列**的最佳全能选择。在速度、显存占用、画质和兼容性之间拥有最均衡的表现，也是大多数用户的推荐格式。\n- **INT8** – 推荐用于 **RTX 30 系列**。相比 BF16 占用更少显存，同时仍能保持非常不错的画质。\n- **NVFP4** – 专为 **RTX 50 系列（Blackwell）** 优化。显存占用最低，在支持的硬件上速度最快，但部分自定义节点目前可能尚未完全兼容。\n\n**快速推荐：**\n- RTX 30xx → **INT8**\n- RTX 40xx → **FP8**\n- RTX 50xx（Blackwell）→ **NVFP4**（若遇到兼容性问题可改用 **FP8**）\n- 追求最高画质 → **BF16（26 GB+ 显存）**"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":776,"type":"Label (rgthree)","pos":[-5506.964901441923,-460.027543078355],"size":[2997.01171875,168],"flags":{"allow_interaction":true},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Moody Minimal Krea Turbo Workflow V3","properties":{"fontSize":168,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontColor":"#ffffff","textAlign":"left","backgroundColor":"transparent","padding":0,"borderRadius":0,"angle":0,"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.5.2"}},"color":"#fff0","bgcolor":"#fff0"},{"id":848,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-5468.446360894436,575.589328011874],"size":[695.0507711487944,507.0004599950705],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Model Links